  "details": "it is possible to change the voice falloff distance as a map creator, but in my experience those are barely used responsibly. \nso its hard to focus on a conversation that i want to, because lots of them are happening, or i get overwhelmed by just too much, so i have to turn down all voices to 0. for a social game that is pretty bad.\nmaps that have a slider that lets you adjust this falloff i never have this problem with. i would like such a slider for the voice falloff to be included in the client settings.",
